# Pinned upstream sources for the host libraries Mesa's mesa_clc builds
# against (nextbsd-toolchain#11). LLVM/clang itself comes from the one pin in
# ../llvm/source.env (llvmorg-19.1.7).
#
# - SPIRV-LLVM-Translator: the v19.1.x line, which tracks LLVM 19 (Mesa 26.2
#   requires LLVMSPIRVLib >= 19.1, < 19.2 when built against LLVM 19.1).
# - SPIRV-Tools + SPIRV-Headers: one Vulkan SDK release, as a matched pair
#   (SPIRV-Tools v2026.4 is tag vulkan-sdk-1.4.363.0, and its DEPS pins the
#   SPIRV-Headers commit that vulkan-sdk-1.4.363.0 tags). Mesa 26.2 requires
#   SPIRV-Tools >= 2024.1 with SetAllowPtrTypeMismatch (SPIRV-Tools#5534). The
#   translator builds against the same SPIRV-Headers; they are 13 commits past
#   the commit its spirv-headers-tag.conf names (575b6512579e), additions only.
#
# GitHub tag archives; each download is refused unless its SHA-256 matches.
SPIRV_LLVM_TRANSLATOR_VERSION=19.1.23
SPIRV_LLVM_TRANSLATOR_URL=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-LLVM-Translator/archive/refs/tags/v19.1.23.tar.gz
SPIRV_LLVM_TRANSLATOR_SHA256=7c47c694b3c24152eaf55770a134631deae9e7d271417da502ea970f731aa923

SPIRV_TOOLS_VERSION=2026.4
SPIRV_TOOLS_URL=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Tools/archive/refs/tags/v2026.4.tar.gz
SPIRV_TOOLS_SHA256=92df4c377603f086c3d2a1eb2bd9b8f883a73ca890fb939d78a0cecdcc01686c

SPIRV_HEADERS_VERSION=vulkan-sdk-1.4.363.0
SPIRV_HEADERS_URL=https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Headers/archive/refs/tags/vulkan-sdk-1.4.363.0.tar.gz
SPIRV_HEADERS_SHA256=5b3a0d099f5c7649e29c0938476c462e71d66ad89a0bde42fa1ba3eb476956c9
